        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyageadayda Sulemani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ning'ata gweanyeew diktam, was dea deasa Sulemani gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea gheanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata ghwadeas Sulemani mujiinajeega ghayi adaw Huramu, ama ng'ata ghwanung' goobiida jeeda fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa Sulemani jeeda ng'eanyiida Hamat-soba, ak ghoang'waay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ng'ata ghwadeas Dadmori aba jeeda dareapcheeda ea gealga sean siitiiwsa haleanjeeda ghayi deeksa ng'eanyiida Hamati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadeas Bet-horoneeda duukusa heetiyeada ea Bet-horoneeda duukusa ng'eanyi, mujiinajeega sineaweesa hilooga, ea ghamarda, ea gidaghuudajeega, ea gharinga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba Baalati, ea mujiinajeega abiita jeeda gheaseeda mideawa Sulemani, ea mujiinajeega mutukwajeagaaschi, ea mujiinajeega fuga manmani faraasajeega, ea gilinyo gagasa ghwadeas Sulemani aba Yerusalemu, ea Lebanoni, ea jeeda ng'eanyiida sean bea gheambalmeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga sean siipuut bea Hiti, ea gea Amori, ea Berisi, ea Hafiti, ea Yebusi, mawasa eemeanagi sea fuga Israeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea jeacheenga nyaawa was gea siipuut iinuweay saawa aba jeeda ng'eanyiida, was fuga mahuuyda fuga Israeli fiisu ghwanung' Sulemani ghoah fuga jea gwasin gadiyoojiga hang'oonyi bwak ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba fuga Israeli ea manung' ghoah soomjooga aba gadiyoojigaaschi; geanung' ghoah shirikara, ea fugaaschi hees, ea shirikarajeega hees bea mutukwajeagaaschi, ea fugaaschi manmani faraasajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak suh ea fuga hees gil bea sugoocheanda was Sulemani, fih bughalaji iyeenya ea haradam ea damanamughuush ghwanung' ghoah fuga hees ahaaghwa suurja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gweana Sulemani huda Farao mujiineeda Dawdi ak ghwaat jeeda gheeda deeksa niny, ak gwayeesha, “Gatmoodeanyu mayghoamu goobiida jeeda gheeda Dawdeeda was sugoocheanda Israeli, aba gideaba heeda siyeadu eayiin sandakwajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA ea ghaydidaat.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoadaw Sulemani NG'UTAMIIDA haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida aba heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi deeksa doodooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gawuurji gichea gaweeda gadiyeeda galeagasean, ea giidaydeayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi gawuurji gidaghayi rukuteayda Musa bea eawoojiga sabaato, ea sheega eesh, ea ghweelmaji samwagu aba jeeda gweayda, was ghweelmeeda mukaateeyda meematawana, ea ghweelmeeda wiikajeega ea ghweelmeeda ghoorajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji deaweeda ghayi bea Dawdeeda was ghwaan, ng'ata gwalaja ashoohoodiga gwasin gadiyoojiga nyaawa, ea fuga Lawi aba gadiyeeda nyaawa bea duumsheesiinda ea gadiyeesiinda ashoohoodiga gawuurji gidasigasiida galeagasean, nea fuga fura gidaghuudajeega nea gwalakiisa geat gidaghuudajeega; gawuurji gidarukteayda Dawdeeda was siida ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea manung'waada gida nirukusa sugoocheanda ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi bea gilinyoo ea gadiyeeda gil ghanea siitiiwiisa haleanjeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean aba damani ghwahit gadiyoojiga sean bea Sulemani gidang'eada eaweeda sinita sindeeta gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA bwak ea ghwahit. Hean ghwahit gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa Sulemani ng'eanyiida Esion-geberi, ea Elioti mida ghuuta basooda, jeeda ng'eanyiida Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeaksa Huramu maleambajeega ak ghwanung' ghwaat fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, ea fuga ammu ghwabwar gaydooda, ak gaweay sean ng'eanyiida Ofiri sea fuga gadiyeeda bea Sulemani, ak ghwaram aba hoowa dalaantaji bughalaji ang'wan ea haradam ea damanamughuush bea lagheanga was dahaabu ak gweadu heeda sugoocheanda was Sulemani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
